        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/141183465?u=62bcb7be09e0fb60d34a8f0e80c1c0f3736419ff&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"https://github.com/practicalrs/rfcs/blob/debug_false_in_test_profile/0000-debug-false-in-test-profile.md\">Rendered</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">IMO this change is a low-hanging fruit that would improve the experience for many Rust developers.</p>",
